{key: D}


{comment: Verse 1}
[D]Nionapo amani [A]kama shwa[D]ri,
[D]Au nio[D/A]na-[A]po shi[D]da;
K[D]wa hali yote Umeni[A]juli[D]sha,
[D]Ni salama [D/A]roho-[A]ni mwa[D]ngu.


{comment: CHORUS}
Sala[D]ma, [A]Roho[D]ni,
[D/F#]Ni salama [D/A]roho-[A]ni mwa[D]ngu.


{comment: Verse 2}
[D]Ingawa Shetani ata[A]nite[D]sa,
[D]Nitajipa [D/A]mo-[A]yo kwa[D]ni;
K[D]risto ameona uny[A]onge wa[D]ngu,
[D]Amekufa [D/A]kwa ro[A]ho ya[D]ngu.




{comment: Verse 3}
[D]Dhambi zangu zote, [A]wala si nu[D]su,
[D]Zimewekwa [D/A]Msa[A]laba[D]ni;
[D]Wala sichukui [A]laana ya[D]ke,
[D]Ni salama [D/A]roho-[A]ni mwa[D]ngu.




{comment: Verse 4}
[D]Ee Bwana himiza siku [A]ya [D]kuja,
[D]Panda ita[D/A]ka-[A]poli-[D]a;
[D]Utakaposhuka sita[A]ogo[D]pa,
[D]Ni salama [D/A]roho-[A]ni mwa[D]ngu.
